flowchart LR

Start((Order Received))

Cond1{"Customer account active?"}

Cond2{"Order value exceeds $10,000?"}

Then1["Create shipment"]

Then2["Request manager approval"]

Else["Reject order and notify customer"]

End((Process Complete))

Start --> Cond1

Cond1 -->|Yes| Cond2

Cond1 -->|No| Else

Cond2 -->|Yes| Then2

Cond2 -->|No| Then1

Then1 --> End

Then2 --> End

Else --> End
